		<item>
		<title>ToysRUs Canada Returning Back at Staples Canada Store Locations in 2027</title>
		<link>https://www.toysnbricks.com/toysrus-canada-returning-back-at-staples-canada-store-locations-in-2027/</link>
					<comments>https://www.toysnbricks.com/toysrus-canada-returning-back-at-staples-canada-store-locations-in-2027/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Ice]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:34:19 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[General]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO News]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=115247</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1217" height="925" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ToysRUs-Canada-at-Staples-Canada-Stores-Website-Landing-Page.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="ToysRUs Canada at Staples Canada Stores Website Landing Page" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ToysRUs-Canada-at-Staples-Canada-Stores-Website-Landing-Page.jpg 1217w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ToysRUs-Canada-at-Staples-Canada-Stores-Website-Landing-Page-300x228.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ToysRUs-Canada-at-Staples-Canada-Stores-Website-Landing-Page-1024x778.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ToysRUs-Canada-at-Staples-Canada-Stores-Website-Landing-Page-768x584.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1217px) 100vw, 1217px" /></p>
<p>In case you haven&#8217;t heard yet, Toys R Us Canada is making a comeback! They will be launching</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/toysrus-canada-returning-back-at-staples-canada-store-locations-in-2027/">ToysRUs Canada Returning Back at Staples Canada Store Locations in 2027</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>In case you haven&#8217;t heard yet, Toys R Us Canada is making a comeback! They will be launching almost 300 locations throughout 2027 at Staples Canada locations. It will be basically a &#8220;store within another store&#8221;. As such, they will be smaller locations compared to their standalone big box stores. The first location was opened in Richmond Hill in Toronto, Canada a few weeks ago.</p>
<p>If I recall correctly, I believe they filed for bankruptcy earlier this year. Many of their big box store locations have shut down. However, there are still a few in Ontario province.</p>
<p><em>Shown below is the Staples Canada website with the Toys R Us Canada section. Its basically Staples Canada&#8217;s toy department.</em></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-115248 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ToysRUs-Canada-at-Staples-Canada-Stores-Website-Landing-Page.jpg" alt="" width="1217" height="925" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ToysRUs-Canada-at-Staples-Canada-Stores-Website-Landing-Page.jpg 1217w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ToysRUs-Canada-at-Staples-Canada-Stores-Website-Landing-Page-300x228.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ToysRUs-Canada-at-Staples-Canada-Stores-Website-Landing-Page-1024x778.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ToysRUs-Canada-at-Staples-Canada-Stores-Website-Landing-Page-768x584.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1217px) 100vw, 1217px" /></p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. For those that prefer mobile device real time push notifications for our LEGO Deals &amp; News, we have the <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Whatsapp Channel</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Discord Channel</a>.</p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
<p><strong>Visit our LEGO Forums:</strong> Where traditional and classic meets our <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legacy LEGO Forums</a>. A library of LEGO resources and for members to ask questions. All articles posted on our main site at Toysnbricks.com are posted in the forums as well. The best part is that there are <span style="text-decoration: underline;">no ads</span> in our LEGO forums. Registration for a basic forum account is free and fast.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113380 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="690" height="551" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 690px) 100vw, 690px" /></p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/toysrus-canada-returning-back-at-staples-canada-store-locations-in-2027/">ToysRUs Canada Returning Back at Staples Canada Store Locations in 2027</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
