		<title>[Site News] Follow Toys N Bricks on Whatsapp &#038; Discord (Mobile Push Device Notifications)</title>
		<link>https://www.toysnbricks.com/site-news-follow-toys-n-bricks-on-whatsapp-discord-mobile-push-device-notifications-dont-miss-out-on-black-friday-lego-deals/</link>
					<comments>https://www.toysnbricks.com/site-news-follow-toys-n-bricks-on-whatsapp-discord-mobile-push-device-notifications-dont-miss-out-on-black-friday-lego-deals/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Ice]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:52:13 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Editor's Picks]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[General]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Site News]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=115239</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="554" height="554" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-logo.jpeg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="whatsapp logo" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-logo.jpeg 554w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-logo-300x300.jpeg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-logo-150x150.jpeg 150w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 554px) 100vw, 554px" /></p>
<p>Times are changing and we must adapt to an ever more challenging, complex, competitive and evolving era. For</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/site-news-follow-toys-n-bricks-on-whatsapp-discord-mobile-push-device-notifications-dont-miss-out-on-black-friday-lego-deals/">[Site News] Follow Toys N Bricks on Whatsapp &#038; Discord (Mobile Push Device Notifications)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Times are changing and we must adapt to an ever more challenging, complex, competitive and evolving era. For mobile device cellphone users, you can now follow us on our <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Whatsapp Channel</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Discord Channel</a>.</p>
<p>We publish mobile device push notifications for our LEGO Deals &amp; News articles over there as well. Remember though that you have to enable and allow push notifications from us in order to get updates. For Whatsapp, your phone number stays completely private as we don&#8217;t get to see what it is. You&#8217;ll get faster real time alerts right to your cellphone rather than traditional methods like through our email newsletters.</p>
<p>This ensure you don&#8217;t miss out on any useful LEGO Deals &amp; News info (especially with Black Friday 2026 Deals coming right up).</p>
<p><center><a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114482" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-logo.jpeg" alt="" width="554" height="554" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-logo.jpeg 554w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-logo-300x300.jpeg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/whatsapp-logo-150x150.jpeg 150w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 554px) 100vw, 554px" /></a><a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114483" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Discord-Logo-Icon.png" alt="" width="554" height="554" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Discord-Logo-Icon.png 554w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Discord-Logo-Icon-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Discord-Logo-Icon-150x150.png 150w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 554px) 100vw, 554px" /></a></center>Of course, you can still always follow us through the traditional methods like our website, RSS Reader/App or email newsletter subscriptions.</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. For those that prefer mobile device real time push notifications for our LEGO Deals &amp; News, we have the <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Whatsapp Channel</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Discord Channel</a>.</p>
<p>At Toys N Bricks, we are committed to service excellence and providing the highest level of care. This means producing good quality and timely work (with both precision and accuracy). We&#8217;re also committed to protecting and helping our readers and forum members. Thank you all for following us over the years and being there for us. Take care everyone. Keep being awesome!</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114941 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Toysnbricks-Logo-900-x150-LEGO-LEGOLAND-Resource-Center-Updated-2-Larger-Wording.jpg" alt="" width="900" height="150" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Toysnbricks-Logo-900-x150-LEGO-LEGOLAND-Resource-Center-Updated-2-Larger-Wording.jpg 900w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Toysnbricks-Logo-900-x150-LEGO-LEGOLAND-Resource-Center-Updated-2-Larger-Wording-300x50.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Toysnbricks-Logo-900-x150-LEGO-LEGOLAND-Resource-Center-Updated-2-Larger-Wording-768x128.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px" /></p>
<p>[We may not be the size like a &#8220;Star Wars Rebel Fleet&#8221; 10-15 years ago, but we are the &#8220;Star Wars Red Five X-Wing Squadron]. (=</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114685 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Star-Wars-75482-Up-Scaled-Luke-Skywalker-Minifigure-January-2027-Release-Date-Lifestyle-4.jpg" alt="" width="1200" height="800" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Star-Wars-75482-Up-Scaled-Luke-Skywalker-Minifigure-January-2027-Release-Date-Lifestyle-4.jpg 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Star-Wars-75482-Up-Scaled-Luke-Skywalker-Minifigure-January-2027-Release-Date-Lifestyle-4-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Star-Wars-75482-Up-Scaled-Luke-Skywalker-Minifigure-January-2027-Release-Date-Lifestyle-4-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Star-Wars-75482-Up-Scaled-Luke-Skywalker-Minifigure-January-2027-Release-Date-Lifestyle-4-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
