										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-115228 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-67023-Marvel-Rivals-Jeff-the-Land-Shark-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box.webp" alt="" width="984" height="984" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-67023-Marvel-Rivals-Jeff-the-Land-Shark-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box.webp 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-67023-Marvel-Rivals-Jeff-the-Land-Shark-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-67023-Marvel-Rivals-Jeff-the-Land-Shark-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-67023-Marvel-Rivals-Jeff-the-Land-Shark-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.webp 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-67023-Marvel-Rivals-Jeff-the-Land-Shark-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 984px) 100vw, 984px" /></p>
<p>A new LEGO Marvel Rivals January 2027 set has been revealed LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). We&#8217;ll look at the release dates, US/Canada prices, set images and more in this article!</p>
<p>Keep it lock to Toys N Bricks and we&#8217;ll let you know when these LEGO 67023 Marvel Rivals: Jeff the Land Shark becomes available!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. For those that prefer mobile device real time push notifications for our LEGO Deals &amp; News, we have the <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Whatsapp Channel</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Discord Channel</a>.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-115235 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-67023-Marvel-Rivals-Jeff-the-Land-Shark-January-2027-Release-Date-Lifestyle-4.webp" alt="" width="1200" height="800" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-67023-Marvel-Rivals-Jeff-the-Land-Shark-January-2027-Release-Date-Lifestyle-4.webp 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-67023-Marvel-Rivals-Jeff-the-Land-Shark-January-2027-Release-Date-Lifestyle-4-300x200.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-67023-Marvel-Rivals-Jeff-the-Land-Shark-January-2027-Release-Date-Lifestyle-4-1024x683.webp 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-67023-Marvel-Rivals-Jeff-the-Land-Shark-January-2027-Release-Date-Lifestyle-4-768x512.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
