										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Happy Tuesday Morning Everyone! <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> currently has a few LEGO deals for this morning. Free shipping on orders above $35. As always, Amazon prices can fluctuate at anytime.</p>
<p>Below are 10 of our Handpicked &amp; Verified Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for This Morning, November 24, 2026. Be sure to subscribe to our email list so you don’t miss out on any other LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in the USA!</p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. For those that prefer mobile device real time push notifications for our LEGO Deals &amp; News, we have the <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Whatsapp Channel</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Discord Channel</a>.</span></p>
<h3>10 Handpicked &amp; Verified Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for This Morning, November 24, 2026</h3>
<ul>
<li>50% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Bluey-Learning-Minifigures-Birthday/dp/B0DRW7Y7SV?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=4349ed220547520a44e331f61e4cdf98&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Bluey: Bluey’s Beach &amp; Family Car Trip 11202</a> <strong>$15</strong> (reg.$29.99)</li>
<li>20% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Mario-Kart-Collectible-Bookshelf/dp/B0G2SWKDM8?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=79cec5da884bccd133c6d51b82ed1605&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Mario Kart – Luigi &amp; Mach 8 72050</a> <strong>$143.95</strong> (reg.$179.99)</li>
</ul>
