					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1280" height="439" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10-Best-Amazon-Canada-LEGO-Deals-Sales-List-for-Today-November-24-2026-scaled-e1795462937964.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="10 Best Amazon Canada LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for Today, November 24, 2026" decoding="async" loading="lazy" /></p>
<p>This article was Human Written by News Reporter. If you&#8217;re doing some LEGO shopping for the holidays, here</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/10-best-amazon-canada-lego-deals-sales-list-for-tonight-november-23-2026/">10 Best Amazon Canada LEGO Deals &#038; Sales List for Tonight, November 23, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
