		<category><![CDATA[LEGOLAND News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGOLAND Resources]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=115190</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="800" height="534" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Driving-School-Car-Ride-California-Florida-New-York-Theme-Park-Attraction-Christmas-Holiday.jpeg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGOLAND Driving School Car Ride California Florida New York Theme Park Attraction Christmas Holiday" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Driving-School-Car-Ride-California-Florida-New-York-Theme-Park-Attraction-Christmas-Holiday.jpeg 800w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Driving-School-Car-Ride-California-Florida-New-York-Theme-Park-Attraction-Christmas-Holiday-300x200.jpeg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Driving-School-Car-Ride-California-Florida-New-York-Theme-Park-Attraction-Christmas-Holiday-768x513.jpeg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" /></p>
<p>This article was Human Written by Contributor Writer. First, LEGOLAND New York isn&#8217;t open year-round. Yes, you’ll get</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/best-time-to-visit-legoland-new-york/">Best Time to Visit LEGOLAND New York</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><em>This article was Human Written by Contributor Writer.</em></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-106332 size-full" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGOLAND-New-York-Front-Gate-Entrance-Main-Banner-Logo-Halloween-Fall.jpg" alt="" width="1496" height="789" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGOLAND-New-York-Front-Gate-Entrance-Main-Banner-Logo-Halloween-Fall.jpg 1496w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGOLAND-New-York-Front-Gate-Entrance-Main-Banner-Logo-Halloween-Fall-300x158.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGOLAND-New-York-Front-Gate-Entrance-Main-Banner-Logo-Halloween-Fall-1024x540.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGOLAND-New-York-Front-Gate-Entrance-Main-Banner-Logo-Halloween-Fall-768x405.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1496px) 100vw, 1496px" /><br />
<span style="font-weight: 400;">First, <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND New York</a> isn&#8217;t open year-round. Yes, you’ll get the Christmas holiday festivities, but after that, the park closes in January to reopen in March. As such, when considering the best time to visit <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND New York</a>, you’ll have to look from April to December.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The Holiday Bricktacular seasonal event runs from November through December. It’s an impressive event for kids, making this period one of the best times to visit the resort. But before we get ahead of ourselves, I’d love to address a few things that will get you the best experience.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">This guide will show the best seasons to plan a trip to the resort. Even better, you’ll learn which days offer the best chance at a satisfactory experience in the park.</span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-104968 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-New-York-Anchors-Away-Pirate-Ship-Ride-Attraction-Banner-Logo-Picture.jpg" alt="" width="1236" height="445" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-New-York-Anchors-Away-Pirate-Ship-Ride-Attraction-Banner-Logo-Picture.jpg 1236w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-New-York-Anchors-Away-Pirate-Ship-Ride-Attraction-Banner-Logo-Picture-300x108.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-New-York-Anchors-Away-Pirate-Ship-Ride-Attraction-Banner-Logo-Picture-1024x369.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-New-York-Anchors-Away-Pirate-Ship-Ride-Attraction-Banner-Logo-Picture-768x277.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1236px) 100vw, 1236px" /></p>
<h2><span style="font-weight: 400;">Key Takeaways</span></h2>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Seasonal events, live shows, and entertainment have their own schedule, which you can confirm with the LEGOLAND Resort mobile app.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">The resort typically closes during the off seasons.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Seasonal events typically have regular day entries.</span></li>
<li><strong>Buy Tickets &amp; Book Hotel Stays at Official LEGOLAND Theme Parks Site &amp; See All Promotions: </strong><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">California, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Florida, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New York, US</a></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114138 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Driving-School-Car-Ride-California-Florida-New-York-Theme-Park-Attraction-Christmas-Holiday.jpeg" alt="" width="800" height="534" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Driving-School-Car-Ride-California-Florida-New-York-Theme-Park-Attraction-Christmas-Holiday.jpeg 800w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Driving-School-Car-Ride-California-Florida-New-York-Theme-Park-Attraction-Christmas-Holiday-300x200.jpeg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Driving-School-Car-Ride-California-Florida-New-York-Theme-Park-Attraction-Christmas-Holiday-768x513.jpeg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" /></p>
<h2><span style="font-weight: 400;">Crowds, Seasons, and Events</span></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">There’s bound to be crowds where there is fun, especially for kids. And trust me when I say that <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND New York</a> has it all when it comes to theme park rides and attractions. It might not be as extensive as <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND California</a> with its water park and the SEA Life Aquarium, but you won’t feel left out.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">I’m not a crowd person, but I’m not going to box everyone into my preference. If you love the crowd energy, then the best time to visit <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND New York</a> will be:</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><b>Summer vacation (June to August)</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">: As you’ve guessed already, this is when parents typically schedule trips to the resort for their kids. The children will be on holiday, making this period the longest stretch of peak operations for the resort.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><b>Spring break (Mid-March to April):</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> It’s a relatively short period, but people do turn up in large numbers. March is when the resort typically opens, coinciding with the Spring Break across New York, New Jersey, and neighboring states. As such, you can expect people to pour in with their kids for a short trip.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><b>Holidays</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">: Some parents don’t wait for the summer vacation or until the Spring Break to take their kids to the park. Instead, they drop in during one- or few-day holidays. Think about holidays like Columbus Day or July 4th.</span></li>
<li><strong>Buy Tickets &amp; Book Hotel Stays at Official LEGOLAND Theme Parks Site &amp; See All Promotions: </strong><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">California, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Florida, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New York, US</a></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Weekends are a blast when it comes to having crowds at the resort. Provided the park is open, you will always find people on weekends. And if you are not careful enough, you’d be stuck in long waiting lines for rides and attractions.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">I know some people who’d prefer a 2-day itinerary on a weekend instead of planning a special vacation. And for those in the city, it’s a quick breeze in, breeze out situation.</span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-112169 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGOLAND-New-York-Jays-Gravity-Force-Trainer-Junior-Driving-School-and-Factory-Adventure-Ride-Banner-Logo-Feature-Attractions.jpg" alt="" width="924" height="595" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGOLAND-New-York-Jays-Gravity-Force-Trainer-Junior-Driving-School-and-Factory-Adventure-Ride-Banner-Logo-Feature-Attractions.jpg 924w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGOLAND-New-York-Jays-Gravity-Force-Trainer-Junior-Driving-School-and-Factory-Adventure-Ride-Banner-Logo-Feature-Attractions-300x193.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGOLAND-New-York-Jays-Gravity-Force-Trainer-Junior-Driving-School-and-Factory-Adventure-Ride-Banner-Logo-Feature-Attractions-768x495.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 924px) 100vw, 924px" /></p>
<h3><span style="font-weight: 400;">Events That Bring Crowds</span></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">For the most collective fun with other kids, the best time to visit <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND New York</a> is during the event periods. You’ll find several seasonal events, and the one for the Christmas Holiday is the Bricktacular.</span></p>
<h4><span style="font-weight: 400;">Holiday Bricktacular</span></h4>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-113868 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGOLAND-Christmas-Bricktacular-Holiday-Winter-California-Banner-Logo.gif" alt="" width="960" height="640" /></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">This event is scheduled to run from November 27, 2026 to January 2, 2027. Some of the locations the event will cover include the theme park, Brick Street, Bricktopia, LEGO NINJAGO World, and Miniland. I couldn’t be happier that one of my favorite spots, Miniland, is among them.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">During Bricktacular, the resort will transform into a winter wonderland, but it doesn’t end there. You’ll find dazzling lights, exclusive holiday builds, and festive shows. On the side, now might be the best time to pick up </span><a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/8-best-lego-sets-for-the-holidays-and-christmas-2026-under-100/"><span style="font-weight: 400;">LEGO sets for the Christmas holiday</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Meet-and-greets are another integral part of this event, along with seasonal treats. If you love holiday shows, then you won’t want your kids to miss this event.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">You and your kids can try out Glice skating across the resort’s winter tink–not me, though; I think I’m getting too old for all that fun.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Also, if your kids want to meet LEGO Santa and also write letters to Santa, this period is the best time to visit the resort.</span></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Buy Tickets &amp; Book Hotel Stays at Official LEGOLAND Theme Parks Site &amp; See All Promotions: </strong><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">California, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Florida, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New York, US</a></li>
</ul>
<h4><span style="font-weight: 400;">Red, White &amp; Boom</span></h4>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-109969 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGOLAND-New-York-July-4-2026-Summer-Fireworks-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="1124" height="317" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGOLAND-New-York-July-4-2026-Summer-Fireworks-Banner-Logo.jpg 1124w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGOLAND-New-York-July-4-2026-Summer-Fireworks-Banner-Logo-300x85.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGOLAND-New-York-July-4-2026-Summer-Fireworks-Banner-Logo-1024x289.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGOLAND-New-York-July-4-2026-Summer-Fireworks-Banner-Logo-768x217.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1124px) 100vw, 1124px" /></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">You won’t get as long a stretch as Bricktacula. This is because the Red, White &amp; Boom event is held only on July 4. But on the bright side, the event still offers a star-spangled spectacle.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Some of the activities you’ll find on this day are:</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Fireworks, but not just any fireworks–the ones that transform into LEGO bricks before your eyes</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Meet &amp; Greet with Lady Liberty</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Live entertainment</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Special activities throughout the resort</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Limited-edition Red, White &amp; Boom Pop Badges</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Note that the pop badges are limited in quantity. If you want one, you’ll have to secure one while supplies last.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Also, note that all the events will happen during the regular day admission at the resort. The event is one you won’t want to miss. But prepare yourself for large crowds and long waiting lines.</span></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Buy Tickets &amp; Book Hotel Stays at Official LEGOLAND Theme Parks Site &amp; See All Promotions: </strong><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">California, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Florida, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New York, US</a></li>
</ul>
<h4><span style="font-weight: 400;">LEGO Festival</span></h4>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-108734 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGOLAND-Festival-Zones-Music-Creative-Chill-Out-California-US-Resort.jpg" alt="" width="960" height="335" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGOLAND-Festival-Zones-Music-Creative-Chill-Out-California-US-Resort.jpg 960w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGOLAND-Festival-Zones-Music-Creative-Chill-Out-California-US-Resort-300x105.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGOLAND-Festival-Zones-Music-Creative-Chill-Out-California-US-Resort-768x268.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px" /></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Even if you’d miss other events, try not to miss the LEGO Festival. It typically comes up during late spring, although the resort is yet to publish information on the schedule. But when that happens, note that it will be your best time to visit <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND New York</a> for the full LEGO experience.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The LEGO Festival typically spans several weekends. During this period, you’ll find building challenges, music, play zones, live shows, and character meet-and-greets. It is one of the most fun-filled periods in LEGOLAND Resorts across the United States.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">While the LEGO Festival brings LEGO-based fun, it comes at the cost of large crowds and waiting lines. If you want to have a quiet tour of the resort with your kids, this isn’t the best time to visit.</span></p>
<ul>
