<h2><span style="font-weight: 400;">When To Visit For Fewer Crowd</span></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">If you want to see fewer crowds at the resort, you have to remove holidays and weekends from your mind. Instead, you’ll have to consider weekdays during off-peak seasons.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Tuesdays, Wednesdays, and Thursdays are my top recommendations when it comes to the best time to visit <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND New York</a> in this context. You can do Fridays, as most weekend visitors typically arrive in the afternoon or evening.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The biggest challenge you’ll face is how you’ll get off work on a weekday to get your kids there. Note that you can also consider the LEGOLAND </span><a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/the-difference-between-legoland-theme-park-resorts-and-legoland-discovery-centers/"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Discovery Centers</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;"> if you can’t make enough time for a full-day tour.</span></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Buy Tickets &amp; Book Hotel Stays at Official LEGOLAND Theme Parks Site &amp; See All Promotions: </strong><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">California, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Florida, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New York, US</a></li>
</ul>
